setPool.t.sol
├── when caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert with {OwnableUnauthorizedAccount} error
└── when caller is the owner
    ├── when the new pool address is the zero address
    │   └── it should revert with {PERPEX__ZERO_ADDRESS} error
    └── when the new pool address is not the zero address
        ├── it should update the pool contract address
        └── it should emit the {PoolUpdated} event
